# Language Test 202505 - Memory Test 2
# Intentionally allocates O(N) integers; the official task is designed to probe memory limits.
Sonome kas N kasta K kasta x kasta y tas Kisite kas readints vis 4.
Sonome kas modulus tas 998244353.
Sonome kas a tas Kisite kas fill vis 0 kasta N.
Kemese kas a[0] tas x.
Palusta N > 1 {
    Kemese kas a[1] tas y.
}
Sonome kas i tas 2.
Sonome kas anchor tas 0.
Pilike palusta i < N {
    Kemese kas anchor tas Kisite kas ponavi vis i - K kasta 0.
    Kemese kas a[i] tas (a[i - 1] + a[i - 2] * a[anchor]) % modulus.
    i += 1.
}
Sonome kas Q tas Kisite kas readint.
Sonome kas previous tas 0.
Sonome kas b tas 0.
Sonome kas index tas 0.
Pilike kas qi pas Kisite kas pilika vis Q {
    Kemese kas b tas Kisite kas readint.
    Palusta qi kate 0 {
        Kemese kas index tas b.
    } Japalusta {
        Kemese kas index tas (b + previous) % N.
    }
    Kemese kas previous tas a[index].
    Takute kas previous.
}
